        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>not used for indexing</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Signs and symptoms of higher cortical dysfunction caused by organic conditions. These include certain behavioral alterations and impairments of skills involved in the acquisition, processing, and utilization of knowledge or information.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Cognitive Manifestations
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Cognitive Symptoms
                    
